# Writer 11 (tally 2.1). L §5.7 LOAD-LEAF "<k> enters <kind>, which has subkinds": with a subkind of the prelude's
# parties declared, a thing entered at parties itself is refused (L §3.5: "enters its parties at parties itself when it
# declares none").
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
kind persons: parties
ask q: count(p in parties on 2026-06-30)

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  parties + [ania] lives 1980-01-01..
=== expect
refused: LOAD-LEAF ...
